- [38;5;10msrc/main.rs[0m — Removed [38;5;10m* 8[0m from all [38;5;10mblake512_update[0m calls in the KAT transcript functions ([38;5;10mkat_tr_init[0m, [38;5;10mkat_tr_absorb_label[0m, [38;5;10mkat_tr_absorb_u64[0m, [38;5;10mkat_tr_absorb_bytes[0m), changing values like [38;5;10m64[0m back to [38;5;10m8[0m, [38;5;10m(len as u64) * 8[0m back to [38;5;10mlen as u64[0m, etc.[0m[0m
